at topics you should write about and how you should communicate your personality in your work. It finishes by looking at the work of a great many successful applicants to America's top colleges, and some unsuccessful students to tell you what to avoid.\n\nQuestion:\nLSAT is most probably   _  .\n\nA. an admission test given by a law school\nB. a test for admitted law students\nC. information on business and college\nD. information on GPA\n\nAnswer with only the letter A, B, C, or D.",
